">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"copy\">© 2026 Sugar &amp; Crumb</div></footer>","pages":{"home":"<section class=\"sc-hero\"><div><h1>Bake it right,<br>the <em>first</em> time.</h1><p>Cakes, cookies and tarts tested in a home oven, written in grams, with every way it can go wrong spelled out.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0\"><a class=\"sc-btn y\" href=\"{{p:recipes}}\">All the bakes</a><a class=\"sc-btn o\" href=\"{{p:pans}}\">Pan converter</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"sc-cake\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"cherry\"></span><span class=\"flag\">Fresh today</span><div class=\"t t1\"></div><div class=\"t t2\"></div><div class=\"t t3\"></div><div class=\"plate\"></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"sc-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"sc-h\"><h2>Fresh from the oven</h2><span>NEW</span></div><div class=\"sc-grid\"><a class=\"sc-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#f2b84b;--c2:#f7c6c7\"></div><div class=\"b\"><h3>Vanilla sponge cake</h3><div class=\"m\"><span>Cake</span><span>55 min</span><span>Easy</span></div></div></a><a class=\"sc-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#8a5a2b;--c2:#f2b84b\"></div><div class=\"b\"><h3>Brown butter chocolate chip cookies</h3><div class=\"m\"><span>Cookies</span><span>30 min</span><span>Easy</span></div></div></a><a class=\"sc-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#f2d649;--c2:#f7c6c7\"></div><div class=\"b\"><h3>Lemon tart</h3><div class=\"m\"><span>Tart</span><span>90 min</span><span>Medium</span></div></div></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"sc-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"sc-conv\"><div class=\"sc-box\"><h3>No 20 cm pan?</h3><p style=\"font:600 16px/1.8 var(--f-body);margin-bottom:18px\">Tell us the pan in the recipe and the one in your cupboard. We'll scale the batter and adjust the time.</p><a class=\"sc-btn\" href=\"{{p:pans}}\">Open the converter</a></div><div class=\"sc-box\" style=\"background:var(--c-secondary)\"><h3>Why did it sink?</h3><p style=\"font:600 16px/1.8 var(--f-body);margin-bottom:18px\">A short guide to the eight most common cake, cookie and tart failures.</p><a class=\"sc-btn o\" href=\"{{p:troubleshoot}}\">Read the guide</a></div></div></section>","recipes":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>All bakes</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:800\">All bakes</h1><p class=\"lead\">Six reliable bakes. Pick one and pre-heat the oven.</p></div></section><section class=\"sc-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"sc-grid\"><a class=\"sc-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#f2b84b;--c2:#f7c6c7\"></div><div class=\"b\"><h3>Vanilla sponge cake</h3><div class=\"m\"><span>Cake</span><span>55 min</span><span>Easy</span></div></div></a><a class=\"sc-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#8a5a2b;--c2:#f2b84b\"></div><div class=\"b\"><h3>Brown butter chocolate chip cookies</h3><div class=\"m\"><span>Cookies</span><span>30 min</span><span>Easy</span></div></div></a><a class=\"sc-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#f2d649;--c2:#f7c6c7\"></div><div class=\"b\"><h3>Lemon tart</h3><div class=\"m\"><span>Tart</span><span>90 min</span><span>Medium</span></div></div></a><a class=\"sc-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#c98a43;--c2:#f7c6c7\"></div><div class=\"b\"><h3>Basque cheesecake</h3><div class=\"m\"><span>Cake</span><span>70 min</span><span>Easy</span></div></div></a><a class=\"sc-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#b36b3a;--c2:#f7c6c7\"></div><div class=\"b\"><h3>Cinnamon rolls</h3><div class=\"m\"><span>Bread</span><span>3 hr</span><span>Medium</span></div></div></a><a class=\"sc-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"--c1:#e45a6b;--c2:#f7c6c7\"></div><div class=\"b\"><h3>Strawberry shortcake</h3><div class=\"m\"><span>Cake</span><span>60 min</span><span>Medium</span></div></div></a></div></section>","recipe":"<section class=\"sc-sec\"><div class=\"sc-h\"><h1 style=\"font:800 clamp(32px,4.6vw,60px)/1.05 var(--f-head);color:var(--c-primary)\">Vanilla sponge cake</h1><span>EASY · 55 MIN</span></div><p style=\"font:600 18px/1.8 var(--f-body);max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:26px\">A light, even sponge that holds frosting and fruit. One bowl, five ingredients, no creaming marathon.</p>\n<div class=\"sc-conv\"><div class=\"sc-box\"><h3>Ingredients · 20 cm round</h3><ul class=\"sc-ing\"><li><span>Butter, soft</span><span>150 g</span></li><li><span>Caster sugar</span><span>150 g</span></li><li><span>Eggs</span><span>3</span></li><li><span>Self-raising flour</span><span>150 g</span></li><li><span>Milk</span><span>2 tbsp</span></li><li><span>Vanilla extract</span><span>2 tsp</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a class=\"sc-btn o\" href=\"{{p:pans}}\">Different pan?</a></p></div>\n<div><ol class=\"sc-steps\"><li><span>Heat the oven to 170°C fan. Grease and line a 20 cm round tin.</span></li><li><span>Beat butter and sugar for 3 minutes until pale. Add eggs one at a time, with a spoon of flour each.</span></li><li><span>Fold in the rest of the flour, milk and vanilla until just combined.</span></li><li><span>Bake 28–32 minutes, until a skewer comes out clean. Cool in the tin for 10 minutes.</span></li></ol></div></div></section>","pans":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Pan converter</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:800\">Pan converter</h1><p class=\"lead\">Round to square, 15 to 26 cm. Get the multiplier and a bake-time hint.</p></div></section><section class=\"sc-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"sc-conv\"><div class=\"sc-box\"><h3>Recipe calls for…</h3><div class=\"sc-row\"><label>Shape<select id=\"sc-s1\"><option value=\"r\">Round</option><option value=\"q\">Square</option></select></label><label>Size (cm)<select id=\"sc-z1\"><option>15</option><option selected>18</option><option>20</option><option>23</option><option>26</option></select></label></div><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px\">I have…</h3><div class=\"sc-row\"><label>Shape<select id=\"sc-s2\"><option value=\"r\">Round</option><option value=\"q\" selected>Square</option></select></label><label>Size (cm)<select id=\"sc-z2\"><option>15</option><option>18</option><option>20</option><option selected>23</option><option>26</option></select></label></div></div><div class=\"sc-res\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"x\" id=\"sc-x\">×1.0</div><p id=\"sc-m\">Same area. No changes needed.</p><span class=\"t\" id=\"sc-b\"></span></div></div></section><script>(function(){var a=document.getElementById(\"sc-s1\");if(!a)return;var ids=[\"sc-s1\",\"sc-z1\",\"sc-s2\",\"sc-z2\"].map(function(i){return document.getElementById(i)});function area(s,z){return s===\"r\"?Math.PI*Math.pow(z/2,2):z*z}function u(){var A=area(ids[0].value,+ids[1].value),B=area(ids[2].value,+ids[3].value),k=B/A,x=document.getElementById(\"sc-x\");x.textContent=\"×\"+(Math.round(k*100)/100).toFixed(2);var m=document.getElementById(\"sc-m\"),b=document.getElementById(\"sc-b\");if(Math.abs(k-1)<.06){m.textContent=\"Nearly the same area. No changes needed.\";b.textContent=\"Bake time: as written\"}else if(k>1){m.textContent=\"Your pan is bigger. Multiply every ingredient by \"+x.textContent.slice(1)+\". The batter will be shallower.\";b.textContent=\"Bake ~\"+Math.round((1-Math.min(.3,(k-1)*.2))*100)+\"% of the time; start checking early\"}else{m.textContent=\"Your pan is smaller. Multiply every ingredient by \"+x.textContent.slice(1)+\". The batter will be deeper.\";b.textContent=\"Bake ~\"+Math.round((1+Math.min(.35,(1-k)*.35))*100)+\"% of the time; lower the oven by 10°C\"}}ids.forEach(function(e){e.addEventListener(\"change\",u)});u()})();</script>","conversions":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Cups, grams & oven temps</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:800\">Cups, grams &amp; oven temps</h1><p class=\"lead\">Quick reference. When in doubt, weigh it.</p></div></section><section class=\"sc-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"sc-conv\"><table class=\"sc-tbl\"><tr><th>Ingredient</th><th>1 cup</th><th>1 tbsp</th></tr><tr><td>Plain flour</td><td>125 g</td><td>8 g</td></tr><tr><td>Caster sugar</td><td>200 g</td><td>12 g</td></tr><tr><td>Brown sugar, packed</td><td>210 g</td><td>14 g</td></tr><tr><td>Butter</td><td>225 g</td><td>14 g</td></tr><tr><td>Cocoa powder</td><td>85 g</td><td>5 g</td></tr></table><table class=\"sc-tbl\"><tr><th>°C</th><th>°C fan</th><th>°F</th><th>Gas</th></tr><tr><td>150</td><td>130</td><td>300</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>160</td><td>140</td><td>325</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>180</td><td>160</td><td>350</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>200</td><td>180</td><td>400</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>220</td><td>200</td><td>425</td><td>7</td></tr></table></div></section>","troubleshoot":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Why did it sink?</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:800\">Why did it sink?</h1><p class=\"lead\">Eight things that go wrong, and what to change.</p></div></section><section class=\"sc-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>My cake sank in the middle</summary><p>The oven door opened too early, or the oven ran cold. Wait until the last 5 minutes before checking, and use an oven thermometer.</p></details><details><summary>Cookies spread into one sheet</summary><p>Butter too warm or too little flour. Chill the dough for 30 minutes and weigh the flour.</p></details><details><summary>Tart base shrank</summary><p>Rest the dough in the tin for 30 minutes before blind-baking, and don't stretch it.</p></details><details><summary>Dense, heavy crumb</summary><p>Over-mixing after adding flour, or old baking powder. Fold gently; test the powder in hot water.</p></details></div></section>","about":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>About</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:800\">About</h1></div></section><section class=\"sc-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"sc-box\" style=\"max-width:640px\"><p style=\"font:600 17px/2 var(--f-body)\">Sugar &amp; Crumb is one baker, one oven and a lot of sunk cakes. Replace this with your story and a photo of your kitchen.</p></div></section>","faq":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>FAQ</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:800\">FAQ</h1></div></section><section class=\"sc-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>Why grams and not cups?</summary><p>Cups vary by up to 30%. Grams are the same every time.</p></details><details><summary>Can I swap butter for oil?</summary><p>In cakes, yes, but the crumb changes. We note it on each recipe.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need a stand mixer?</summary><p>No recipe here requires one.</p></details></div></section>","privacy":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Privacy policy</b></div><h1 style=\"\">Privacy policy</h1></div></section><section class=\"sc-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"prose\"><p>Replace with your privacy policy: what you collect, why, how long you keep it and how customers can ask for deletion.</p></div></section>","404":"<section class=\"sc-sec\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(50px,9vw,120px)\"><div class=\"sc-cake\" style=\"max-width:240px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"cherry\"></span><div class=\"t t1\"></div><div class=\"t t3\"></div><div class=\"plate\"></div></div><h1 style=\"font:800 clamp(60px,12vw,140px)/1 var(--f-head);color:var(--c-accent);margin-top:14px\">404</h1><p style=\"margin:10px 0 26px;font:700 20px var(--f-body)\">Someone ate this page.</p><a class=\"sc-btn y\" href=\"{{p:home}}\">Back to the bakery</a></section>"}}